OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FFor a generation of football
OL,7,Fsupporters, he's remembered as one of
OL,8,Fthe most feared strikers in Europe.
OL,10,FEx-Brazil star Alexandre Pato, 36, is
OL,11,Fbest known for his successful six-year
OL,12,Fstint at Italian giants AC Milan, but
OL,13,Fspeculation is rife that he could
OL,14,Fabout to swap the iconic red and black
OL,15,Fof the Rossoneri for another set of
OL,16,Fstripes.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
