CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FLeague Two play-off chasers Colchester
OL,7,FUnited have confirmed that Pato was a
OL,8,Fguest of chairman Robbie Cowling for
OL,9,FSaturday's 2-1 victory over Fleetwood
OL,10,FTown, with the Colchester Gazette
OL,11,Freporting that he could be about to
OL,12,Flaunch a sensational bid to buy the
OL,13,Fclub.
OL,15,FThe U's have stopped short of saying
OL,16,Fthat Pato's appearance was definitely
OL,17,Flinked to a potential takeover, but
OL,18,Fthe news has certainly got tongues
OL,19,Fwagging in Essex and beyond.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
