OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FOnce hailed as Brazil's next big
OL,7,Fthing, Pato shot to prominence as a 17-
OL,8,Fyear-old in 2006 when he became the
OL,9,Fyoungest player to score in a senior
OL,10,Fmen's FIFA tournament - beating Pele's
OL,11,Frecord that had stood for almost 50
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,FHis strike for Brazilian club
OL,15,FInternacional at the Club World Cup
OL,16,Fattracted the interest of some of
OL,17,FEurope's biggest clubs, including AC
OL,18,FMilan who won the race for his
OL,19,Fsignature.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FThe E24m fee would prove to be money
OL,7,Fwell spent, with Pato becoming a
OL,8,Fprolific goalscorer during his time at
OL,9,FSan Siro - including one of the
OL,10,Ffastest goals in Champions League
OL,11,Fhistory when he netted the opener
OL,12,Fafter just 24 seconds in a clash
OL,13,Fagainst Barcelona in 2011.
OL,15,FHis career would ultimately fail to
OL,16,Flive up to its early promise though,
OL,17,Fwith injuries playing a key part in
OL,18,Fhis fall from grace.
OL,26,@nD@EOk
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/13
