OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FHe struggled to make any kind of
OL,7,Fimpact during a short loan spell at
OL,8,FChelsea in 2016, before ending his
OL,9,Fplaying days back in homeland at Sao
OL,10,FPaulo after stints in Spain, China and
OL,11,Fthe USA.
OL,13,FHe also won 27 caps for Brazil,
OL,14,Fscoring 10 goals, with of one those
OL,15,Fcoming against Belarus at the London
OL,16,F2012 Olympics.
OL,18,FAway from the pitch, his life was
OL,19,Fequally as colourful, his party boy
OL,20,Flifestyle seeing him date a string of
OL,21,FBrazilian actresses and models.
OL,26,@qD@ctp
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/13
