CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FHe is now married to television
OL,7,Fpresenter Rebeca Abravanel with whom
OL,8,Fhe has one child.
OL,10,FColchester United chairman Robbie
OL,11,FCowling has been actively looking to
OL,12,Fsell the club for a while now, and the
OL,13,Fclub have confirmed Pato was
OL,14,Fdefinitely in attendance for the U's
OL,15,Fmost recent game against Fleetwood.
OL,17,FColchester Gazette journalist Jon
OL,18,FWaldron took a photograph of Pato and
OL,19,FCowling together on the pitch before
OL,20,Fthe match, adding further fuel to the
OL,21,Ffire.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
