PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FUS-based Lightwell Sports Group,
OL,7,Fheaded by American businessman Tim
OL,8,FFoley, had previously been close to
OL,9,Fbuying the club from Cowling, but a
OL,10,Fdeal collapsed in June last year.
OL,12,FIt has now been reported that Pato is
OL,13,Fpart of a consortium interested in a
OL,14,Ftakeover, although any announcement
OL,15,Fappears to still be some way off.
OL,17,FIf Pato does decide to proceed, he
OL,18,Fwould inherit a club that are on the
OL,19,Ffringes of the League Two play-offs,
OL,20,Fwith the U's having won their last
OL,21,Fthree matches.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
