PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,F"The chairman always said he wanted
OL,7,Fhis best decision to be his last so
OL,8,Fhe's been looking all over for owners.
OL,9,FSo someone with credibility like Pato
OL,10,Fcould really be the change this club
OL,11,Fneeds because if he joins with a
OL,12,Fconsortium of investors, perhaps it
OL,13,Fmight be possible for us to get to the
OL,14,Fnext level, so it's very exciting."
OL,16,FFriend Harry McCarthy, 19, said he was
OL,17,Fhoping it would be the boost the team
OL,18,Fneeded to help get promotion back to
OL,19,FLeague One.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/13
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
