PN,30911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1770115588
OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,F"I'm very optimistic usually - I was
OL,7,Fwith with the (rumoured takeover by
OL,8,Fthe) Americans before so, I'm hoping
OL,9,Fit's not the same situation where it
OL,10,Ffalls forever, but I'm optimistic of
OL,11,Fit this time."
OL,13,FAnd he believes the players will be
OL,14,Fexcited at the prospect too.
OL,16,F"I think they'll definitely be
OL,17,Fexcited. I mean I know they shouldn't
OL,18,Fbe thinking about it too much but I'm
OL,19,Fsure it's in the back of their mind."
OL,26,@oD@OpmpD@Dpn
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/13
