OL,3,CEx-AC Milan & Brazil star reportedly
OL,4,Cin talks to buy League Two club
OL,6,FFelix agreed, adding: "We've got a lot
OL,7,Fof characters in the dressing room so
OL,8,FI feel like they will almost thrive
OL,9,Foff that. For example our striker
OL,10,F(Micah Mbick), who's currently subject
OL,11,Fto a multi-million pound bid from a
OL,12,FPremier League club and he still
OL,13,Fscored at the weekend so I don't think
OL,14,Fthese players let pressure affect
OL,15,Fthem.'
OL,17,FThe fans are already speculating on
OL,18,Fwhether a cash influx could see
OL,19,Fimprovements to training facilities or
OL,20,Fmore money for Danny Cowley to spend
OL,21,Fon new players.
OL,26,@rD@ApmrD@Mpn
